# mall.fk: a small mall of single assemblers, placed by hand and mixed with a row. Plot 34x44.
# The router lays the belts between them; a chest one tile from its machine gets one inserter.
# Run:  fk check mall.fk    fk build --to report_checks
# Expect: `check mall: 12 machines, 8 nets, 0 check lines`; `mall: 8 nets: 8 connected, 0 open, 0
# unrouted`; `bootstrap net mall/fe: its route needs 68 transport-belt and 5 inserter ...` (the
# mall's route needs items only the mall makes: stock them first).
fein  = Chest<requester, item=iron-plate, rate=2/s>   @(0, 11)
cuin  = Chest<requester, item=copper-plate, rate=1/s> @(0, 26)
gear  = Assembler<recipe=iron-gear-wheel>             @(6, 2)
belt  = Assembler<recipe=transport-belt>              @(13, 2)
ins   = Assembler<recipe=inserter>                    @(20, 10)
cable = Assembler<recipe=copper-cable>                @(6, 25)
circ  = Assembler<recipe=electronic-circuit>          @(13, 18)
pipe  = AsmRow<n=2, recipe=pipe>                      @(6, 33)
bbox  = Chest<provider, limit=4>                      @(18, 3)
ibox  = Chest<provider, limit=4>                      @(25, 11)
pbox  = Chest<provider, limit=4>                      @(14, 34)

net fe:    fein -> gear, circ, belt, ins, pipe
net cu:    cuin -> cable
net gears: gear -> belt, ins
net cab:   cable -> circ
net circs: circ -> ins
net belts: belt -> bbox
net inss:  ins -> ibox
net pipes: pipe -> pbox
